# The app (frontend/) needs no environment variables and holds no secrets: everything it shows comes from the API.
# Copy to frontend/.env only if you want to change the setting below.

# --- Local development (pnpm dev) ---
# Where the dev server forwards /api and /o. Change it if your API runs on another port.
# API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# --- Production (AWS) ---
# Not set here. CloudFront serves the built app from S3 and forwards /api and /o to the backend (infra/main.tf), so the
# browser only ever talks to one address and the sign-in cookie keeps working. Deploy: Actions → "Deploy app (AWS)".
